      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1736206200468,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Australia: Drone 40\n\nChina: CH-901 Rainbow (FH-901), WS-43\n\nIsrael: Harop, Harpy, Hero-30, Hero-120, Orbiter 1K, ROTEM L, SkyStriker,\nSpike Firefly\n\nPoland: Warmate\n\nRussia: KUB-BLA, Lancet-3\n\nSouth Korea: Devil Killer\n\nTaiwan: Chien Hsiang, Fire Cardinal\n\nTurkey: Alpagu, Kargu-2\n\nUnited Kingdom: Fire Shadow\n\nUnited States: Battlehawk, Phoenix Ghost, Switchblade 300, Switchblade 600",
      "fontSize": 20,
